          <description xml:base="https://kyleparkercunningham.com/oeuvre/other/2021/fall-2021/">&lt;p&gt;A log book of November 2021.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Truth or Consequences, New Mexico&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
